				{ title = "The Scholomance", tip = "The Scholomance lies under Caer Darrow, the island town in the south-east of the Western Plaguelands: you need its key or a rogue to open the door, and Rattlegore's Viewing Room Key to go deeper. Use the Imp in a Jar at the alchemy lab in Ras Frostwhisper's room; J'eevee makes the parchment. Bring a group.", zone = 1422, goals = {
