					{ kind = "buy", npc = 14437, item = 18670, note = "Xorothian Glyphs" },
				} },
				{ title = "The ritual in Dire Maul", tip = "Dire Maul stands in the ruins of central Feralas; the ritual circle is in its west wing, past Immol'thar, and the door needs the Crescent Key or a rogue. Use J'eevee's Jar to start; when the bell, the wheel or the candle fades, click it with the Black Lodestone (a Soul Shard each). When the demons stop coming, use the Xorothian Glyphs, defeat the Xorothian Dreadsteed and its dreadlord master, and speak to the Dreadsteed Spirit. Bring a group.", zone = 1444, goals = {
